C: box "C" fit
X: box "X" fit at 1cm south of C


OP: box "Operand &larr;" fit at 2cm right of C.e
Z: text "0" fit at 1cm right of OP.e

text "ASL" bold at 0.5cm north of OP

arrow from OP.w to C.e
dot at 0.5cm west of OP.w
arrow from last dot down 1cm then left to X.e

arrow from Z.w to OP.e




MSB: box "MSB" fit at 2cm south of OP
right
OP2: box "Operand &rarr;" fit
text "ASR" bold at 0.5cm north of OP2.w

arrow from MSB.s down 0.5cm then left 1cm then up until even with MSB.w then right to MSB.w

C2: box "C" fit at 2.25cm right of OP2
X2: box "X" fit at 1cm south of C2
arrow from OP2.e to C2.w
dot at 0.5cm right of OP2.e
arrow from last dot down 1cm then right to X2.w